    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "you're missing the point. i'm not talking about some past attempt. i'm talking about my actual life. my career, my name, my family... it's all gone. they've already erased me. in every way that matters, i don't exist anymore. people look through me like i'm a stain on the sidewalk. what's the point of even trying to \"be safe\" when there is nothing left to save?",
